Table per-cell alignment override

```
|= Item     |=> Qty |
| Apple      | 12     |
| Subtotal   |< 12    |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th style="text-align: right;">Qty</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Apple</td><td style="text-align: right;">12</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Subtotal</td><td style="text-align: left;">12</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
